  "description": "Yeogyeong has it all: she’s the heiress to a wealthy family and the youngest executive ever appointed at a major Korean corporation.\n\nBut behind her picture-perfect life lies a secret she can never afford to reveal.\n\nWhenever it rains, her age changes.\n\nBorn with a mysterious syndrome passed down through generations, Yeogyeong has spent her entire life bound by strict limitations. Then, during a seemingly endless monsoon season, a mysterious man suddenly steps into her carefully controlled world...\n\nAnd for the first time, the life she’s worked so hard to protect begins to change.\n\n\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61557256), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B9%84%EC%98%A4%EB%8A%94-%EB%82%A0%EC%9D%98-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%84/3860)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/timentherain), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/159259)",
